    "detailed_description": "Explore a hand-drawn world of trash with your giant robot, trusty sun-orb, and (lack of) platforming skills!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207960/extras/8327f3dbbe85a73fd34d4afe63a7e633.avif?t=1730412489\" width=616 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D Side-Scrolling Platformer Goodness<br></li><li>Jump, Kick, and Catch your way through unnaturally well-crafted terrain<br></li><li>Manage your dash/double jump charge through careful planning and execution<br></li><li>Traverse a colorful world of trash on its last leg<br></li><li>Decide your own path - Levels don't need to be played in a strict order<br></li><li>Fill up your base with items collected throughout your journey</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207960/extras/5c6e3e889070569e7ec53978a96c75ca.avif?t=1730412489\" width=616 height=264 /></span><br> This is a game inspired heavily by Mario World Kaizo. Brace yourself.",
    "about_the_game": "Explore a hand-drawn world of trash with your giant robot, trusty sun-orb, and (lack of) platforming skills!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207960/extras/8327f3dbbe85a73fd34d4afe63a7e633.avif?t=1730412489\" width=616 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D Side-Scrolling Platformer Goodness<br></li><li>Jump, Kick, and Catch your way through unnaturally well-crafted terrain<br></li><li>Manage your dash/double jump charge through careful planning and execution<br></li><li>Traverse a colorful world of trash on its last leg<br></li><li>Decide your own path - Levels don't need to be played in a strict order<br></li><li>Fill up your base with items collected throughout your journey</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207960/extras/5c6e3e889070569e7ec53978a96c75ca.avif?t=1730412489\" width=616 height=264 /></span><br> This is a game inspired heavily by Mario World Kaizo. Brace yourself.",
